MP3 decoder core (src/third_party/dr_mp3_core.h)

The decoder is dr_mp3 as embedded in miniaudio.h (miniaudio 0.11.x by David Reid), which is minimp3 by lieff (CC0) with
additions. Only the frame decoder is kept. It is released into the public domain, or under MIT-0 if public domain does not
apply in your jurisdiction (see the end of miniaudio.h):

